<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
 <meta charset="utf-8">
 <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
 <meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
 <title>豆包汽车 · 业务学习站</title>
 <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Crect width='64' height='64' rx='10' fill='%23eaf2fc'/%3E%3Ctext x='32' y='46' text-anchor='middle' font-size='44' fill='%23245ca6'%3ED%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">
 <meta name="description" content="按模块阅读豆包汽车业务机制、流程、案例、异常与来源；保留完整业务链路和原始节点。">
 <style>:root{--ink:#20354a;--body:#30465a;--muted:#617487;--quiet:#8291a0;--line:#dce4eb;--soft:#f5f8fa;--blue:#245ca6;--blue-soft:#eaf2fc;--teal:#1d756e;--teal-soft:#eef7f4;--amber:#865b1a;--amber-soft:#fff7e9;--red:#9c4148;--red-soft:#fff3f3;--sidebar:260px;--header:76px;--toc:210px;--radius:8px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;color:var(--body);background:#fff;font-size:16px;font-synthesis:none}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-padding-top:100px}body{margin:0;min-height:100dvh}button,input,textarea,select{font:inherit}button,a,input,textarea,summary{touch-action:manipulation}button,a{-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}button{cursor:pointer}a{color:var(--blue);text-decoration:none}a:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}button:active{transform:translateY(1px)}:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #76a7db;outline-offset:3px}button,input,textarea{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px}button{color:var(--ink);background:#fff;padding:9px 13px}button:hover{border-color:#a8bacb;background:var(--soft)}button.primary{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}button.primary:hover{background:#194d92}h1,h2,h3,h4,p,ul,ol,figure,blockquote{margin-top:0}p,li{overflow-wrap:anywhere}h1,h2,h3,h4{color:var(--ink);font-weight:650}h1{font-size:32px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin-bottom:18px}h2{font-size:25px;line-height:1.45;letter-spacing:-.015em;margin-bottom:20px}h3{font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:14px}h4{font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:10px}p{line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:18px}ul,ol{padding-left:25px}li{line-height:1.8;margin:8px 0}code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;background:#edf2f6;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:.86em;overflow-wrap:anywhere}small{font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}strong{font-weight:650;color:var(--ink)}hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin:32px 0}::selection{background:#d8eafb}button[aria-pressed=true]{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue);background:var(--blue-soft)}[hidden]{display:none!important}.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}.skip-link{position:fixed;top:-80px;left:16px;z-index:1000;padding:12px 18px;background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--blue);border-radius:6px}.skip-link:focus{top:10px}
.site-header{height:var(--header);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:30;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;padding:0 26px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.98);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.site-header .global-search{margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;flex:0 0 208px;font-size:17px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.4;color:var(--ink)}.brand:hover{text-decoration:none}.brand-mark{display:grid;place-items:center;width:34px;height:36px;border:1px solid #b9d1e6;border-radius:7px;color:var(--blue);background:#edf5fb;font-size:22px;font-weight:600}.brand-subtitle{font-size:12px;display:block;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.06em;font-weight:500}.global-search{display:flex;align-items:center;max-width:640px;flex:1;height:40px;background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:0 7px 0 12px;gap:8px}.global-search:focus-within{border-color:#7ca7d4;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #e6eff9}.global-search input{width:100%;min-width:0;border:0;outline:0;background:transparent;font-size:14px;height:36px;box-shadow:none}.global-search button{padding:4px 8px;border:0;background:transparent;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--blue);font-size:13px}.search-symbol{font-size:24px;line-height:1;color:var(--muted)}kbd{font:12px ui-monospace,monospace;border:1px solid #ced8e2;border-radius:4px;padding:1px 6px;color:var(--muted);background:#fff}.header-notes{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-left:auto;white-space:nowrap;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}.count-badge{font-size:11px;border-radius:4px;padding:1px 5px;background:#eef3f7;color:var(--blue)}.icon-button{min-width:36px;min-height:36px;padding:4px;font-size:24px;line-height:1;display:inline-grid;place-items:center}.mobile-menu{display:none}.site-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:var(--sidebar) minmax(0,1fr) var(--toc);max-width:1800px;margin:auto}.site-sidebar{position:sticky;top:var(--header);height:calc(100dvh - var(--header));overflow-y:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;border-right:1px solid var(--line);background:#fbfcfd;padding:22px 16px 40px}.nav-group{margin:24px 0}.nav-group:first-child{margin-top:0}.nav-group-title{color:var(--quiet);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.07em;margin:0 10px 9px;font-weight:650}.nav-item{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:9px;padding:9px 10px;margin:2px 0;color:#53687c;border-radius:5px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5}.nav-item:hover{background:#eff4f8;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}.nav-item[aria-current=page]{background:var(--blue-soft);color:var(--blue);font-weight:650}.nav-code{color:#8298ab;min-width:19px;font-size:10px;line-height:21px;font-weight:600}.nav-item[aria-current=page] .nav-code{color:var(--blue)}.nav-title{flex:1}.nav-done{font-size:12px;color:var(--teal);margin-top:1px}.nav-caption{font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--quiet);border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:26px;padding:18px 10px 0}.nav-bottom-links{display:flex;gap:14px;font-size:12px;margin:12px 10px}.nav-backdrop{display:none}.page-toc{position:sticky;top:var(--header);height:calc(100dvh - var(--header));overflow-y:auto;padding:36px 22px 35px 12px;font-size:12px}.toc-title{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--quiet);margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:650}.toc-link{display:block;padding:7px 0 7px 12px;border-left:1px solid var(--line);line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted)}.toc-link:hover{color:var(--blue);text-decoration:none}.toc-link.active{border-left:2px solid var(--blue);color:var(--blue);font-weight:650;padding-left:11px}.toc-link.sub{font-size:11px;padding-left:21px}.toc-divider{margin:18px 0}.toc-stat{font-size:11px;color:var(--quiet);line-height:1.7}#main-content{min-width:0;padding:0 44px 70px}#main-content:focus{outline:none}#page-root{max-width:1050px;margin:auto}.page-header{padding:42px 0 26px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:32px}.breadcrumbs{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;color:var(--quiet);font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:24px}.breadcrumbs span{color:var(--muted)}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;font-weight:650;color:var(--teal);letter-spacing:.09em;margin-bottom:12px;line-height:1.5}.page-lead{font-size:18px;line-height:1.9;max-width:760px;color:var(--body);margin-bottom:22px}.page-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 16px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.page-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:20px}.page-actions button,.page-actions a{font-size:12px;padding:8px 12px;line-height:1.4}.button-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:9px 13px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}.button-link:hover{text-decoration:none;background:var(--soft);border-color:#a8bacb}.button-link.primary{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;border-color:var(--blue)}.button-link.primary:hover{background:#194d92}.prose{font-size:17px;line-height:1.85}.prose p{max-width:80ch}.section{margin:0 0 54px;scroll-margin-top:105px}.section>h2{padding-top:6px}.section-kicker{display:block;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.07em;color:var(--quiet);margin-bottom:8px}.section-intro{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;margin-top:-8px;margin-bottom:23px}.note-panel{border-left:3px solid #a8c9df;background:#f2f7fb;padding:18px 22px;margin:24px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85}.note-panel p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}.note-panel.warning{border-color:#d6b779;background:var(--amber-soft)}.note-panel.teal{border-color:#87bbb0;background:var(--teal-soft)}.note-panel.error{border-color:#d29b9f;background:var(--red-soft)}.boundary-list{margin:0}.boundary-list>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:98px minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px 0}.boundary-list>div:first-child{padding-top:4px}.boundary-list dt{font-size:13px;font-weight:650;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.9}.boundary-list dd{margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.9}.inline-label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;font-size:11px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;padding:2px 6px;line-height:1.5;background:#fff;color:var(--muted);vertical-align:middle}.inline-label.planned{color:var(--amber);border-color:#e7d5b5;background:var(--amber-soft)}.inline-label.warning{color:var(--red);border-color:#e5c7ca;background:var(--red-soft)}.inline-label.teal{color:var(--teal);border-color:#c4dfd6;background:var(--teal-soft)}
.home-intro{max-width:780px}.home-starts{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin:25px 0 28px}.reading-path{border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:20px 0;margin:30px 0;gap:10px 6px;align-items:center}.path-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;font-size:13px;gap:7px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--soft);color:var(--ink)}.path-link:hover{background:var(--blue-soft);text-decoration:none}.path-arrow{font-size:16px;color:#8b9cab}.path-number{font-size:10px;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--blue)}.directory-group{margin:30px 0}.directory-group h3{font-size:16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:13px}.directory-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px minmax(0,1fr) 25px;gap:20px;padding:17px 3px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf2;align-items:start;color:var(--body)}.directory-row:hover{text-decoration:none;background:#f8fafc}.directory-row .directory-name{font-size:15px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:600;line-height:1.7}.directory-row p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;margin:0}.directory-row .arrow{color:#8398aa;padding-top:2px}.directory-code{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--quiet);font-weight:400}.focus-modules{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;column-gap:30px;margin:20px 0}.focus-module{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:20px 0}.focus-module h3{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:9px}.focus-module p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;margin:0;color:var(--muted)}.system-warning{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:18px;margin-top:25px}
.flow-figure{margin:24px 0 30px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;background:#fff}.figure-header{padding:18px 20px 13px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;border-bottom:1px solid #e6ecf2}.figure-header h3{font-size:16px;margin-bottom:5px}.figure-header p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;margin:0;color:var(--muted)}.figure-tools{display:flex;gap:5px;flex-shrink:0}.figure-tools button{font-size:12px;padding:5px 9px;min-height:30px}.figure-tools output{min-width:39px;font-size:11px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--muted)}.svg-shell{overflow:auto;max-height:660px;min-height:100px;overscroll-behavior:contain;background:#fcfdff;padding:14px}.svg-shell svg{display:block;max-width:none;width:100%;height:auto;min-width:610px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}.svg-shell svg [data-page],.svg-shell svg [data-node],.svg-shell svg [data-step],.dialog-canvas svg [data-page],.dialog-canvas svg [data-node],.dialog-canvas svg [data-step]{cursor:pointer}.svg-shell svg [role=link]:focus,.dialog-canvas svg [role=link]:focus{outline:3px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:3px}.figure-caption{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);padding:10px 20px;line-height:1.75;border-top:1px solid #e9eef3;background:#fff}.flow-step-list{margin:20px 0 30px;counter-reset:step}.flow-step{position:relative;padding:0 0 26px 45px;border-left:1px solid #ccdbe7;margin-left:14px;scroll-margin-top:110px}.flow-step:last-child{padding-bottom:0;border-left-color:transparent}.flow-step:before{counter-increment:step;content:counter(step);position:absolute;left:-15px;top:0;width:29px;height:29px;border:1px solid #c1d4e4;background:#f2f7fb;border-radius:50%;font-size:11px;font-weight:650;color:var(--blue);display:grid;place-items:center}.flow-step h4{font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:10px}.flow-step p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:10px}.flow-step .step-outgoing{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);background:var(--soft);padding:10px 13px;margin-top:12px}.step-outgoing a{font-size:12px}.steps-intro{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}.edge-label{display:block;color:var(--quiet);font-size:11px;line-height:1.75;margin-top:4px}.node-list{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.node-detail{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);scroll-margin-top:110px}.node-detail summary{list-style:none;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;cursor:pointer;padding:20px 4px}.node-detail summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.node-detail summary:after{content:'＋';color:var(--muted);margin-left:auto;font-size:18px;font-weight:400}.node-detail[open] summary:after{content:'−'}.node-detail summary:hover .node-title{color:var(--blue)}.node-id{font-size:10px;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--quiet);min-width:35px;line-height:26px}.node-title{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}.node-kind{font-size:10px;line-height:25px;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--muted);margin-left:auto}.node-body{padding:0 8px 25px 51px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.9}.node-body p{margin-bottom:16px}.node-contract{margin:0 0 19px;list-style:none;padding:0}.node-contract li{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;padding-left:16px;position:relative;margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted)}.node-contract li:before{content:'—';position:absolute;left:0;color:#95a7b7}.node-links{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px}.relation-columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:26px;margin:25px 0}.relation-columns h3{font-size:15px}.relation-list{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}.relation-list li{padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin:0;line-height:1.7}.relation-list a{font-size:14px}.relation-list p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;margin:6px 0 0}.relation-meta{font-size:10px;color:var(--quiet)}.related-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:200px minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:16px 0;font-size:14px}.related-row p{margin:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8}.node-full-contract{padding:20px 23px;background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--line);margin:25px 0}.node-full-contract ul{margin:0}
.case-article{margin:28px 0 38px}.case-article+.case-article{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:32px}.case-article h3{font-size:19px}.query-block{margin:17px 0 23px;border-left:3px solid #92b9d8;padding:10px 18px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--ink);background:#f5f9fc}.query-block:before{content:'用户说';display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:4px}.case-steps{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}.case-steps li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:125px 1fr;gap:20px;margin:0;padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e9eef2;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85}.case-steps .actor{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);padding-top:2px}.case-failure{margin:20px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;padding:16px 19px;background:var(--amber-soft);border-left:3px solid #d2b17b}.question-list{counter-reset:question}.question-item{margin:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:22px}.question-item h3{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8}.question-item h3:before{counter-increment:question;content:counter(question,decimal-leading-zero) ' ';font-size:12px;color:var(--quiet);margin-right:5px}.question-item>p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.85}.answer-disclosure summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;color:var(--blue);padding:4px 0}.answer-body{padding:16px 18px;margin-top:12px;background:var(--soft);font-size:14px;line-height:1.9}.answer-body p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}.answer-label{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);display:block;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px}.question-check{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:15px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}.question-check input{accent-color:var(--teal);width:15px;height:15px}.table-scroll{overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;margin:20px 0 24px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;line-height:1.9}th,td{padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left;vertical-align:top;min-width:100px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}th{background:#f3f7fa;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap}tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}.metric-table td:first-child{min-width:130px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}.metric-table td:nth-child(2){min-width:240px}.metric-table td:last-child{min-width:150px}.roadmap-item{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:23px 0}.roadmap-item:first-child{padding-top:4px}.roadmap-item h3{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:12px}.roadmap-heading{display:flex;gap:15px;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap}.roadmap-item p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:14px}.roadmap-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:650;display:block;margin-bottom:4px}.term-list{margin:0}.term-item{padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.term-item dt{font-size:14px;font-weight:650;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px}.term-item dd{margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.9}.source-strip{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:10px;color:var(--quiet);margin:16px 0}.source-strip .source-chip{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);padding:2px 6px;border:1px solid #dfe7ee;border-radius:3px;max-width:270px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}.source-chip:hover{color:var(--blue);background:var(--soft);text-decoration:none}.source-list{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}.source-item{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:22px 0;scroll-margin-top:110px}.source-item h3{font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 8px}.source-item p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.9;margin:6px 0 12px}.source-id{font-size:10px;color:var(--quiet);font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;margin-bottom:7px}.source-actions{display:flex;gap:14px;font-size:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.source-consumers{font-size:11px;color:var(--quiet);line-height:1.8;margin-top:12px}.source-consumers a{display:inline-block;margin:4px 9px 0 0}.coverage-domain{padding:18px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.coverage-domain h3{font-size:16px}.coverage-domain p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:8px}.research-note{font-size:13px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--muted)}
.search-page-form{display:flex;gap:10px;margin:25px 0}.search-page-form input{flex:1;min-width:0;padding:12px 14px;font-size:16px}.search-filters{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:16px 0 24px}.search-filters button{font-size:12px;padding:6px 10px}.search-summary{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:20px}.search-result{padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.result-category{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.03em;color:var(--teal);margin-bottom:8px}.search-result h3{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:9px}.search-result p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}.result-footer{font-size:11px;color:var(--quiet)}mark{background:#fff0be;color:inherit;padding:0 1px}.empty-state{padding:36px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin:20px 0}.empty-state h2{font-size:21px}.empty-state p{font-size:15px;max-width:650px;color:var(--muted)}.search-suggestions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:20px}.search-suggestions a{background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:6px 10px;font-size:12px}.search-more{margin:25px 0}.tools-categories{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:20px 0}.tools-categories a{font-size:12px;padding:6px 9px;background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px}.tool-group{margin:36px 0}.tool-list{list-style:none;padding:0}.tool-row{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(170px,1fr) minmax(210px,1.3fr) 70px;gap:20px;padding:17px 0;line-height:1.75}.tool-row h3{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 6px}.tool-name{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.tool-row p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.85;margin:0}.tool-row>a{font-size:12px;align-self:center}.tool-contract-section{padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.tool-contract-section h2{font-size:21px}.tool-contract-section p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.95}.state-chain{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin:18px 0 24px}.state-tag{font-size:13px;padding:7px 11px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;background:var(--soft)}.note-editor{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:24px;margin-top:35px}.note-editor label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px}.note-editor textarea{display:block;width:100%;min-height:150px;resize:vertical;padding:14px 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;background:#fcfdfe}.note-help{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11px;color:var(--quiet);margin:9px 0}.note-editor .note-help p{margin:0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.75}.study-summary{display:flex;gap:32px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:18px 0 28px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:25px}.study-stat strong{font-size:24px;font-weight:600;display:block;color:var(--ink)}.study-stat span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.progress-track{height:5px;border-radius:2px;background:#e9f0f5;overflow:hidden;margin:14px 0}.progress-track span{display:block;height:100%;background:#568eae;border-radius:2px}.study-module{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:13px 0;font-size:14px}.study-module small{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;display:block;margin-top:4px}.study-module button{font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap;padding:6px 9px}.saved-note{padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.saved-note h3{font-size:16px}.saved-note p{white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:13px}.saved-note footer{font-size:11px;color:var(--quiet);display:flex;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap}.storage-warning{font-size:12px;color:var(--red);line-height:1.8;margin:12px 0}.article-footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:25px;margin-top:50px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:30px}.article-footer a{font-size:15px;line-height:1.8}.article-footer span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:5px}.article-footer a:last-child{text-align:right}.loading-notice{padding:45px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}.fallback-notice{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:13px 16px;line-height:1.85;margin:20px 0}.return-top{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;margin:30px 0}.error-box{border:1px solid #e0bdc2;padding:20px;background:var(--red-soft);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px}.highlight-target{animation:targetFlash 2s ease-out}@keyframes targetFlash{0%{background:#fff2c8}100%{background:transparent}}
.modal-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(23,42,60,.45);display:grid;place-items:center;padding:20px}.diagram-dialog{width:min(1500px,100%);height:calc(100dvh - 40px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;border-radius:9px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 90px rgba(22,44,63,.2)}.dialog-header{padding:16px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:center;flex-shrink:0}.dialog-header .eyebrow{font-size:10px;margin-bottom:4px}.dialog-header h2{font-size:19px;margin:0}.dialog-header .icon-button{font-size:27px}.dialog-toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:10px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);flex-shrink:0}.dialog-toolbar p{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin:0;line-height:1.7}.button-group{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center}.button-group button{font-size:12px;padding:7px 10px;white-space:nowrap}.button-group output{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);min-width:45px;text-align:center}.dialog-canvas{overflow:auto;flex:1;background:#f2f6f9;padding:24px;overscroll-behavior:contain;cursor:grab;touch-action:pan-x pan-y}.dialog-canvas.dragging{cursor:grabbing}.dialog-canvas svg{display:block;background:#fff;max-width:none;height:auto;min-width:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}.dialog-canvas:focus{outline-offset:-4px}.toast{position:fixed;bottom:24px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:130;background:#243e53;color:#fff;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;max-width:calc(100% - 32px);box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(20,45,64,.16)}
.walkthrough-summary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:34px minmax(0,1fr);gap:18px;padding:25px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.walkthrough-summary-number{font:12px ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace;color:var(--quiet);padding-top:6px}.walkthrough-summary h2,.walkthrough-summary h3{font-size:20px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 10px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.walkthrough-summary-query{font-size:16px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--ink);margin:0 0 13px}.walkthrough-summary-scope{font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:13px}.walkthrough-summary-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px 18px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted)}.walkthrough-list.compact .walkthrough-summary{padding:20px 0}.walkthrough-list.compact .walkthrough-summary h3{font-size:17px}.walkthrough-list.compact .walkthrough-summary-query{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}.walkthrough-query{border-left:3px solid #92b9d8;padding:16px 21px;background:#f4f8fc;margin:24px 0}.walkthrough-query>span{display:block;font-size:10px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}.walkthrough-query p{font-size:19px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--ink);margin:0}.walkthrough-step-nav ol{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:0 26px;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:20px 0 0}.walkthrough-step-nav li{min-width:0;margin:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.walkthrough-step-nav a{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;min-width:0;padding:15px 10px 15px 2px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--body);border-radius:4px}.walkthrough-step-nav a:hover{text-decoration:none;background:var(--soft)}.walkthrough-step-nav a[aria-current=step]{background:var(--blue-soft);color:var(--blue)}.walkthrough-nav-number{font:11px/24px ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace;color:var(--blue);min-width:24px}.walkthrough-step-nav a>span:last-child{min-width:0}.walkthrough-step-nav strong{font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;display:block;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:inherit}.walkthrough-step-nav small{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;display:block;margin-top:4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.walkthrough-step{padding:27px 0 34px;border-top:2px solid #d7e4ef;margin-bottom:24px;scroll-margin-top:100px}.walkthrough-step:focus{outline:none}.walkthrough-step-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:40px minmax(0,1fr);gap:15px;margin-bottom:15px}.walkthrough-step-heading .eyebrow{margin:0 0 7px;font-size:10px}.walkthrough-step-heading h2{font-size:24px;line-height:1.6;margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.walkthrough-step-number{display:grid;place-items:center;width:35px;height:35px;border:1px solid #bad1e4;border-radius:50%;font:13px ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace;color:var(--blue);background:#f5f9fc;margin-top:18px}.walkthrough-actor{font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;margin:20px 0 12px}.walkthrough-actor>span{font-size:11px;font-weight:650;color:var(--muted);margin-right:14px}.walkthrough-module-links{display:flex;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 14px;margin:12px 0 24px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8}.walkthrough-module-links>span:first-child{font-size:10px;color:var(--quiet)}.walkthrough-facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:27px;margin:25px 0;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.walkthrough-facts>div{min-width:0}.walkthrough-facts h3{font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:11px}.walkthrough-facts>div:first-child h3{color:var(--teal)}.walkthrough-facts>div:last-child h3{color:var(--amber)}.walkthrough-facts ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px}.walkthrough-facts li{font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;margin:7px 0}.walkthrough-facts .research-note{margin-bottom:0}.walkthrough-contract{margin:0}.walkthrough-field{display:grid;grid-template-columns:153px minmax(0,1fr);gap:22px;padding:19px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e7edf2}.walkthrough-field dt{font-size:12px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.9;color:var(--muted);padding-top:2px}.walkthrough-field dd{font-size:16px;line-height:1.95;margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.walkthrough-field.evidence dt{color:var(--teal)}.walkthrough-field.failure dt{color:var(--amber)}.walkthrough-step-footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px 22px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:17px;margin-top:23px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8}.walkthrough-step-footer span{color:var(--quiet);font-size:11px}.figure-tools{flex-wrap:wrap}.mobile-page-toc{display:none}
@media(max-width:1100px){.mobile-page-toc{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:12px 0 24px;margin-top:-14px}.mobile-page-toc label{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap}.mobile-page-toc select{font-size:12px;min-width:0;max-width:100%;flex:1;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:8px;background:#fff;color:var(--body);border-radius:5px}}
@media(min-width:1800px){.site-header{padding-left:max(26px,calc((100vw - 1748px)/2));padding-right:max(26px,calc((100vw - 1748px)/2))}}
@media(max-width:1320px){:root{--sidebar:238px;--toc:178px}.site-header{gap:18px;padding:0 20px}.brand{flex-basis:200px}#main-content{padding-left:32px;padding-right:30px}.page-toc{padding-right:12px}.node-body{padding-left:42px}.directory-row{grid-template-columns:160px 1fr 18px;gap:16px}.tool-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(150px,1fr) minmax(180px,1.1fr) 52px;gap:14px}}
@media(max-width:1100px){:root{--sidebar:235px;--toc:0px}.site-layout{grid-template-columns:var(--sidebar) minmax(0,1fr)}.page-toc{display:none}.global-search{max-width:none}.brand{flex-basis:198px}#main-content{padding-left:30px;padding-right:30px}.page-header{padding-top:32px}.page-lead{font-size:17px}.focus-modules{gap:25px}.figure-header{flex-direction:column;gap:11px}.figure-tools{align-self:flex-end}.dialog-toolbar p{max-width:370px}.directory-row{grid-template-columns:145px 1fr 18px}.tool-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(130px,1fr) minmax(190px,1.3fr) 48px}}
@media(max-width:760px){:root{--header:64px;--sidebar:280px}.site-header{padding:0 14px;gap:12px}.mobile-menu{display:inline-grid;min-width:33px;min-height:34px;font-size:19px;border-color:transparent}.brand{flex:0 0 auto;font-size:14px;gap:8px}.brand-mark{display:none}.brand-subtitle{font-size:10px}.global-search{height:35px;padding-left:9px;gap:4px;min-width:0}.global-search input{font-size:12px;height:32px}.global-search input::placeholder{font-size:11px}.global-search button{padding:3px 4px;font-size:11px}.global-search kbd,.search-symbol,.header-notes{display:none}.site-layout{display:block}.site-sidebar{position:fixed;left:0;top:var(--header);width:280px;height:calc(100dvh - var(--header));z-index:50;transform:translateX(-100%);transition:transform .22s ease-out;background:#fff;box-shadow:12px 0 24px rgba(29,49,66,.07)}body.nav-open .site-sidebar{transform:translateX(0)}.nav-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:var(--header) 0 0 0;z-index:40;border:0;border-radius:0;background:rgba(24,45,62,.25);padding:0}body.nav-open .nav-backdrop{display:block}.nav-backdrop:hover{background:rgba(24,45,62,.25)}#main-content{padding:0 20px 50px}.page-header{padding-top:25px;margin-bottom:28px}.breadcrumbs{font-size:11px;margin-bottom:20px}.eyebrow{font-size:10px}h1{font-size:27px;line-height:1.5}h2{font-size:23px}h3{font-size:19px}.page-lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.9}.prose{font-size:16px}.section{margin-bottom:42px}.page-meta{font-size:11px;gap:7px 12px}.page-actions{gap:7px}.page-actions button,.page-actions a{font-size:11px}.boundary-list>div{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px;padding:17px 0}.boundary-list dt{font-size:11px}.boundary-list dd{font-size:15px}.note-panel{padding:16px 17px;font-size:14px}.focus-modules{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}.directory-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(130px,.9fr) 1.4fr 13px;gap:12px;padding:16px 0}.directory-row .directory-name{font-size:14px}.directory-row p{font-size:12px}.reading-path{gap:7px 4px}.path-link{font-size:12px;padding:6px 8px}.path-arrow{font-size:12px}.node-detail summary{gap:7px;padding:17px 0}.node-title{font-size:15px}.node-id{min-width:32px;font-size:9px}.node-kind{display:none}.node-body{padding-left:7px;padding-right:7px;font-size:15px}.node-contract li{font-size:12px}.relation-columns{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px}.related-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:7px}.case-steps li{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:4px;font-size:15px;padding:14px 0}.case-steps .actor{font-size:11px}.query-block{font-size:17px}.question-item h3{font-size:16px}.question-item>p{font-size:13px}.figure-header{padding:15px 15px 10px}.figure-tools{align-self:flex-start}.svg-shell{max-height:520px;padding:8px}.svg-shell svg{min-width:640px}.figure-caption{padding:10px 14px}.flow-step{padding-left:32px;margin-left:12px}.flow-step p{font-size:15px}.flow-step h4{font-size:16px}.flow-step:before{width:25px;height:25px;left:-13px}.table-scroll{margin-left:-3px;margin-right:-3px}th,td{padding:12px;font-size:12px}.tool-row{grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:9px 12px}.tool-row p{grid-column:1/3;grid-row:2}.tool-row>a{grid-column:2;grid-row:1;align-self:start}.tool-contract-section p{font-size:16px}.roadmap-heading{gap:8px}.search-page-form input{font-size:14px;padding:10px 12px}.search-page-form button{font-size:13px;padding:8px 12px}.search-result h3{font-size:17px}.search-result p{font-size:13px}.study-summary{gap:24px}.study-stat strong{font-size:22px}.study-module{font-size:13px}.note-help{flex-direction:column;gap:4px}.article-footer{gap:20px}.article-footer a{font-size:13px}.modal-backdrop{padding:0}.diagram-dialog{height:100dvh;border-radius:0}.dialog-header{padding:12px 14px}.dialog-header h2{font-size:16px}.dialog-toolbar{display:block;padding:10px 14px}.dialog-toolbar p{font-size:10px;margin-top:8px;max-width:none}.button-group{gap:4px}.button-group button{padding:6px 8px;font-size:11px}.dialog-canvas{padding:12px}.toast{bottom:16px;font-size:12px}}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){[data-diagram-theme=adaptive] .svg-shell,.dialog-canvas[data-diagram-theme=adaptive],.dialog-canvas[data-diagram-theme=adaptive] svg{background:#17212d}}
@media(max-width:760px){.walkthrough-summary{grid-template-columns:24px minmax(0,1fr);gap:12px;padding:22px 0}.walkthrough-summary h2,.walkthrough-summary h3{font-size:18px}.walkthrough-summary-query{font-size:15px}.walkthrough-summary-meta{font-size:11px}.walkthrough-query{padding:14px 16px}.walkthrough-query p{font-size:17px}.walkthrough-step-nav ol{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:0}.walkthrough-step-nav a{padding:13px 5px}.walkthrough-step-nav strong{font-size:14px}.walkthrough-step-heading{grid-template-columns:33px minmax(0,1fr);gap:11px}.walkthrough-step-number{width:30px;height:30px;font-size:11px;margin-top:20px}.walkthrough-step-heading h2{font-size:21px}.walkthrough-actor{font-size:14px}.walkthrough-facts{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px;padding:18px 0}.walkthrough-facts li{font-size:14px}.walkthrough-field{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:6px;padding:16px 0}.walkthrough-field dt{font-size:11px}.walkthrough-field dd{font-size:15px;line-height:1.95}.walkthrough-step-footer{font-size:11px}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*:before,*:after{scroll-behavior:auto!important;animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
@media print{.site-header,.site-sidebar,.page-toc,.page-actions,.figure-tools,.article-footer,.note-editor,.modal-backdrop,.toast,.skip-link{display:none!important}.site-layout{display:block}#main-content{padding:0}.page-header{padding-top:0}.section{break-inside:auto;margin-bottom:28px}.node-detail{break-inside:avoid}.node-detail>.node-body{display:block!important}.svg-shell{max-height:none;overflow:visible}.svg-shell svg{min-width:0!important;width:100%!important}.source-strip{display:block}.source-strip a{border:0}.table-scroll{overflow:visible}.section h2{break-after:avoid}.page-toc{display:none}.query-block{break-inside:avoid}body{font-size:12pt}.prose{font-size:12pt}}
.dialog-caption{font-size:12px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--muted);padding:10px 22px;margin:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8fafc;max-height:100px;overflow:auto;flex-shrink:0}

/* Teaching edition: continuous reading first, source records on demand. */
.lecture-prose{max-width:920px;font-size:18px;line-height:2;color:var(--body);overflow-wrap:break-word}
.lecture-prose p{margin:0 0 1.25em;letter-spacing:.015em}
.lecture-opening{margin:0 0 48px;padding-bottom:22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.diagram-lesson{margin:0 0 30px;padding:12px 0 6px}
.diagram-lesson h3{font-size:23px;line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 24px}
.diagram-lesson p{margin-bottom:1.4em}
.guide-node-link{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid #95b6ca;color:#245b79;font-size:.94em}
.guide-node-link:hover,.guide-node-link:focus{background:#eef5f9;border-color:#245b79}
.reference-archive{margin:18px 0 28px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:transparent}
.reference-archive>summary{padding:16px 4px;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;line-height:1.7}
.reference-archive[open]>summary{color:var(--ink);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.reference-content{padding:22px 4px 5px}
.reference-content>.section{margin-top:32px}
.flow-reference{margin-top:0}
.figure-evidence{margin-top:9px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);max-width:700px}
.figure-evidence summary{cursor:pointer;line-height:1.8}
.figure-evidence p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;margin:10px 0 0}
.flow-section+.flow-section{margin-top:64px;padding-top:30px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.course-lecture{margin-top:32px}
.dialog-content{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);flex:1;min-height:0;overflow:hidden}
.dialog-content.has-reading{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 390px}
.dialog-content .dialog-canvas{min-width:0;min-height:0}
.diagram-reading{padding:24px;overflow-y:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;border-left:1px solid var(--line);font-size:16px;line-height:1.95;background:#fff}
.diagram-reading h3{font-size:20px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:22px}
.diagram-reading p{margin-bottom:24px}
.dialog-evidence{flex-shrink:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.dialog-evidence>summary{padding:8px 22px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
.dialog-evidence .dialog-caption{border-bottom:0;padding-top:0}
@media(max-width:900px){.dialog-content.has-reading{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);grid-template-rows:minmax(160px,52%) minmax(0,1fr)}.diagram-reading{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px 20px}.dialog-toolbar .button-group{flex-wrap:wrap}}
@media(max-width:760px){.lecture-prose{font-size:16px;line-height:1.95}.lecture-opening{margin-bottom:34px}.diagram-lesson{padding-top:4px}.diagram-lesson h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:20px}.reference-archive>summary{font-size:13px}.flow-section+.flow-section{margin-top:40px;padding-top:20px}}

/* Case-led reading: prose before diagrams, no repeated appendices. */
.lecture-prose{max-width:900px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.95;color:#2e4357}
.lecture-prose p{margin:0 0 1.25em;letter-spacing:.01em}
.lecture-opening{margin-bottom:36px}
.section>h2{font-size:25px;line-height:1.55;max-width:900px;margin-bottom:24px}
.chapter-ending{padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.figure-header h3{font-size:18px;margin:0;line-height:1.6}
.flow-figure{margin-bottom:28px;background:#fff}
.flow-figure[data-diagram-theme=adaptive] .svg-shell{background:#fff;max-height:760px;padding:18px}
.flow-figure[data-diagram-theme=original] .svg-shell{max-height:720px}
.diagram-lesson{padding:4px 0 16px;margin-bottom:30px}
.diagram-lesson h3{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:22px}
@media(max-width:760px){.lecture-prose{font-size:16px;line-height:1.95}.section>h2{font-size:22px}.flow-figure[data-diagram-theme=adaptive] .svg-shell{max-height:630px;padding:10px}.figure-header h3{font-size:16px}}


/* Detailed diagram reading, preserving the existing chapter. */
.diagram-guide-step{margin:30px 0 34px}.diagram-guide-step h4{font-size:20px;line-height:1.65;color:#20374c;margin:0 0 15px;font-weight:650}.diagram-guide-step p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}@media(max-width:760px){.diagram-guide-step h4{font-size:18px}.diagram-guide-step{margin:25px 0 30px}}


/* Feynman reading: one causal story, retrieval practice, then source detail. */
.feynman-start{max-width:900px;margin:0 0 40px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:22px}.feynman-goal{font-size:18px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}.feynman-scenario{font-size:20px;line-height:1.85}.feynman-scope{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.9}.feynman-scope summary{cursor:pointer;padding:8px 0}.feynman-scope p{margin-top:12px}.feynman-practice{font-size:16px;line-height:1.9}.feynman-practice>button{min-height:44px;margin:8px 0 22px}.feynman-practice label{display:block;margin:18px 0 8px}.feynman-practice textarea{display:block;resize:vertical;width:100%;min-height:150px;padding:14px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.9}.feynman-save{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}.feynman-answer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px 0;margin:18px 0}.feynman-answer summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--blue);padding:10px 0;min-height:44px}.feynman-answer p{margin-top:15px;line-height:1.95;font-size:17px}.feynman-variations article{padding:16px 0 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.feynman-variations h3{font-size:19px}.feynman-course.is-recalling .feynman-reading{display:none}.feynman-course.is-recalling .feynman-start{display:none}.feynman-reference{margin-top:38px}#page-root.recall-mode>#detailed-flow,#page-root.recall-mode>#flows,#page-root.recall-mode>.reference-archive{display:none}@media(max-width:760px){.feynman-goal{font-size:16px}.feynman-scenario{font-size:18px}.feynman-answer p{font-size:16px}.feynman-scope{font-size:14px}.feynman-variations h3{font-size:18px}}


.chapter-bridge{max-width:900px;margin:0 0 34px;padding:20px 22px;background:#f4f7fb;border-left:3px solid #245ca6}.chapter-bridge .bridge-label{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:#5a7191}.chapter-bridge p:last-child{margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.95;color:#1c2b3d}.chapter-opening{margin:0 0 26px}.chapter-opening summary{cursor:pointer;color:#245ca6;font-size:15px;padding:10px 0;min-height:44px}.chapter-opening .lecture-prose{margin-top:10px;font-size:16px;color:#3a4859}.chapter-practice{margin:44px 0 10px;border-top:1px solid #dbe3ec;padding-top:18px}.chapter-practice>summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:17px;color:#245ca6;padding:12px 0;min-height:44px}.practice-body{font-size:16px;line-height:1.9}.practice-body>button{min-height:44px;margin:10px 0 18px}.practice-body label{display:block;margin:16px 0 8px}.practice-body textarea{display:block;width:100%;min-height:140px;padding:14px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.85;resize:vertical}.practice-save{font-size:13px;color:#68778a;margin-top:8px}.practice-answer{border-top:1px solid #e3e9f1;margin:16px 0;padding:10px 0}.practice-answer summary{cursor:pointer;color:#245ca6;padding:10px 0;min-height:44px}.practice-answer p{margin-top:14px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.95}.practice-transfer article{padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e9f1}.practice-transfer h3{font-size:18px}.is-hidden{display:none!important}@media(max-width:760px){.chapter-bridge{padding:16px 16px}.chapter-bridge p:last-child{font-size:17px}.practice-body textarea{font-size:16px}}

.chapter-mainline{max-width:900px;margin:0 0 34px}.chapter-mainline h2{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 12px;color:#1c2b3d}.chapter-mainline p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.95;margin:0 0 16px}.detail-heading{max-width:900px;margin:38px 0 14px;font-size:18px;color:#5a7191;border-bottom:1px solid #dbe3ec;padding-bottom:10px}
.chapter-mainline h3{font-size:17px;margin:26px 0 10px;color:#245ca6;font-weight:600}
.concept-card{max-width:900px;margin:0 0 26px;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid #dbe3ec;border-radius:6px;background:#fbfcfe}.concept-card h3{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:18px;color:#1c2b3d}.concept-card dl{margin:0}.concept-card dt{font-weight:600;color:#245ca6;font-size:14px;margin:12px 0 4px}.concept-card dd{margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.85;color:#2b3a4d}
/* V-only teaching edition; the remaining chapters retain their previous styles. */
.voice-lesson{max-width:1080px;color:#263f53}
.voice-lesson .voice-opening,.voice-lesson .voice-prose{font-size:18px;line-height:2}
.voice-lesson p{margin:0 0 24px}
.voice-lesson .voice-opening{margin-bottom:48px}
.voice-lesson .voice-opening>p:last-child{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#66788a;padding-left:14px;border-left:2px solid #c4d3df}
.voice-lesson .section{margin-top:48px;padding-top:32px;scroll-margin-top:100px}
.voice-lesson .section>h2{font-size:25px;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:28px;max-width:40em}
.voice-lesson .voice-citations{font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:#778797;margin-top:24px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e8edf1}
.voice-lesson .voice-citations a{color:#597388;text-decoration:none}
.voice-lesson .voice-citations a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.voice-table-scroll{max-width:100%;overflow:auto;margin:28px 0;border:1px solid #dce5ed;border-radius:7px}
.voice-table-scroll table{width:100%;min-width:720px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;table-layout:fixed}
.voice-table-scroll th,.voice-table-scroll td{vertical-align:top;text-align:left;padding:16px 17px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e9ef}
.voice-table-scroll thead th{background:#f0f5f9;font-weight:600;color:#254358}
.voice-table-scroll tbody th{font-weight:550;background:#f9fbfd}
.voice-table-scroll tr:last-child>*{border-bottom:0}
.voice-lesson .flow-figure[data-diagram-theme=adaptive] .svg-shell{max-height:none;overflow-y:hidden;overflow-x:auto;padding:12px;background:white;overscroll-behavior:auto}
.voice-lesson .figure-header{flex-wrap:wrap}
.voice-lesson .figure-header h3{font-size:17px;line-height:1.5}
.voice-lesson .flow-figure{margin:32px 0;background:#fff}
.voice-original{margin:30px 0;border:1px solid #dce5ed;border-radius:6px;padding:16px}
.voice-original>summary{cursor:pointer;color:#2d5c85;font-size:16px;padding:6px 0;line-height:1.7}
.voice-original .svg-shell{max-height:800px}
@media(max-width:760px){.voice-lesson .voice-opening,.voice-lesson .voice-prose{font-size:17px;line-height:1.95}.voice-lesson .section>h2{font-size:22px}.voice-lesson .section{margin-top:36px;padding-top:26px}.voice-lesson p{margin-bottom:22px}.voice-table-scroll td,.voice-table-scroll th{padding:12px}.voice-lesson .figure-tools{flex-wrap:wrap}.voice-lesson .voice-citations{font-size:12px}}
@media print{.voice-lesson .figure-tools,.voice-lesson .voice-citations{display:none}.voice-lesson .svg-shell{overflow:visible!important;max-height:none!important}.voice-lesson .svg-shell svg{width:100%!important;min-width:0!important}.voice-lesson .flow-figure{break-inside:avoid}.voice-lesson h2{break-after:avoid}.voice-table-scroll{overflow:visible}.voice-table-scroll table{min-width:0}}

</style>
</head>
<body>
 <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">跳到正文</a>
 <header class="site-header">
 <button class="icon-button mobile-menu" id="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-label="打开模块目录" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="site-sidebar"><span aria-hidden="true">☰</span></button>
 <form class="global-search" id="search-form" role="search"><label class="sr-only" for="global-search">搜索场景步骤、模块、流程节点、工具与术语</label><span class="search-symbol" aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input id="global-search" type="search" placeholder="搜索场景、模块、工具…" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"><button type="submit" aria-label="提交搜索">搜索</button><kbd aria-hidden="true">/</kbd></form>
 </header>
 <div class="site-layout">
 <aside class="site-sidebar" id="site-sidebar" aria-label="全站模块目录"><div id="sidebar-content"></div></aside>
 <button class="nav-backdrop" id="nav-backdrop" type="button" aria-label="关闭模块目录" hidden></button>
 <main id="main-content" tabindex="-1"><div id="page-root"><p class="loading-notice">正在读取本地学习内容…</p></div><noscript><p>请启用 JavaScript 后重新打开，以阅读模块、搜索和查看流程图。</p></noscript></main>
 <aside class="page-toc" id="page-toc" aria-label="本页目录"></aside>
 </div>
 <div class="modal-backdrop" id="diagram-modal" hidden>
 <section class="diagram-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="diagram-dialog-title" aria-describedby="diagram-dialog-caption" tabindex="-1">
 <header class="dialog-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">可缩放流程图</p><h2 id="diagram-dialog-title">流程图</h2></div><button class="icon-button" id="diagram-close" type="button" aria-label="关闭流程图">×</button></header>
 <div class="dialog-toolbar"><div class="button-group"><button type="button" data-modal-zoom="out" aria-label="缩小流程图">−</button><output id="diagram-zoom-label" aria-live="polite">100%</output><button type="button" data-modal-zoom="in" aria-label="放大流程图">+</button><button type="button" data-modal-zoom="fit">适合宽度</button><button type="button" data-modal-zoom="actual">原始尺寸</button><button type="button" id="diagram-reading-toggle" aria-controls="diagram-reading" aria-expanded="true" hidden>收起讲解</button></div><p>拖动或滚动看图；对照旁边的讲解沿节点读。按 Esc 关闭。</p></div>
 <details class="dialog-evidence" id="diagram-evidence"><summary>图的阅读说明</summary><p class="dialog-caption" id="diagram-dialog-caption"></p></details>
 <div class="dialog-content" id="diagram-content"><div class="dialog-canvas" id="diagram-canvas" tabindex="0" aria-label="可滚动的流程图画布"></div><aside class="diagram-reading" id="diagram-reading" aria-label="这张图的连续讲解" hidden></aside></div>
 </section>
 </div>
 <div id="toast" class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
 